      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The ogre is a 7th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Intelligence (spell save DC 14, +6 to hit with spell attacks). The ogre has the following mage spells prepared: Cantrips (at will): <em>✦ arcane blast, blade ward, create bonfire, fire bolt</em> 1st level (4 slots): <em>armor of agathys, mage armor, magic missile</em> 2nd level (3 slots): <em>enlarge/reduce, scorching ray, see invisibility</em> 3rd level (3 slots): <em>✦ arcane explosion, glyph of warding, haste, slow</em> 4th level (1 slot): <em>✦ arcane barrage</em> <em>The ogre casts mage armor on itself before combat.</em></p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
